+<sect1>Monitoring
+<label id="babel-monitoring">
+
+<p><cf/show babel routes/ shows each route's smoothed metric when hysteresis is
+enabled. The <cf/+/ marker indicates a currently feasible candidate and <cf/*/
+indicates the selected route. <cf/show babel entries/ shows the last selection
+reason and the number of changes between reachable next hops for each prefix.
+Initial selection and withdrawal are not counted; the counter is reset when
+the prefix entry is removed or the protocol restarts.
